&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Deployments run smoothly, on time, and against clearly defined success metrics&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Customers leave deployment confident, excited, and ready to scale&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
