&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to work cross-functionally with Sales, Product, and Engineering teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills — able to explain complex technical concepts clearly to diverse audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong project management and organizational skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
