&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a Revenue Analytics Manager to join our Business Data &amp;amp; Intelligence team at a critical inflection point. As Cresta scales, this role exists to build and own the analytical infrastructure that powers our GTM engine — translating data from across Sales, Marketing, and Customer Success into trusted, decision-ready insights. Reporting directly to the Senior Director of Business Data &amp;amp; Intelligence, you&#39;ll be a senior individual contributor and emerging team leader — owning a broad portfolio of recurring reporting, building scalable dashboards, and driving automation that multiplies the team&#39;s impact. This is the right role for someone who has thrived in a startup environment, is technically strong, business-fluent, and energized by the challenge of bringing order and insight to a fast-moving, high-growth company.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sales, Marketing &amp;amp; CS Reporting&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own recurring reporting across Sales, Marketing, and CS: pipeline, win rates, ARR, funnel performance, churn/retention metrics, and usage data&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain reporting infrastructure in Looker Studio, BigQuery, and Salesforce&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure reports are accurate, timely, and accessible to the right stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify trends and surface insights proactively — don&#39;t wait to be asked&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dashboard Architecture &amp;amp; Build&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and build standard and mid-complexity dashboards for GTM stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with the Senior Director on architecture for high-visibility exec-facing dashboards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish dashboard standards: naming conventions, refresh cadences, data source documentation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain a self-service reporting culture — build dashboards people can trust and use without hand-holding&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Automation &amp;amp; Operational Efficiency&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and eliminate manual, repetitive processes across the BD&amp;amp;I team and GTM stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build automated workflows in Salesforce, Looker Studio, and adjacent tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Document automation logic and maintain operational runbooks for key recurring processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stakeholder Support&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own complex and ambiguous ad hoc requests&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate business questions into clear analytical frameworks and communicate findings clearly — in writing, in dashboards, and in live settings&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Quality &amp;amp; Governance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the escalation point for data quality and SFDC issues — investigate root causes and drive resolution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish and enforce data standards across reporting domains you own&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure GTM KPI definitions are consistent and documented&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Qualifications&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5–8 years in data analytics, business intelligence, or GTM/Revenue Operations — with meaningful experience at a startup or high-growth SaaS company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to operate autonomously in an ambiguous, fast-moving environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ownership of reporting across at least two GTM functions (Sales, Marketing, or CS)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong proficiency in Looker Studio or comparable BI tool (Tableau, Power BI)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with Salesforce — reporting, data model, and CRM operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working SQL with BigQuery or equivalent cloud data warehouse experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written and verbal communication — comfortable presenting findings to leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly organized, detail-oriented, and able to manage multiple workstreams simultaneously&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building Claude or LLM-powered internal tools or workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with Upside, Snowflake, or similar modern data stack tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience in a formal manager or team lead role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in GTM compensation, quota, or territory analytics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to board-level or C-suite reporting cycles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Salesforce Flows or process automation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive compensation &amp;amp; equity, aligned with experience and market benchmarks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comprehensive medical, dental, and vision insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Remote-first culture with opportunities for in-person collaboration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional development budget for courses, conferences, and ongoing learning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous PTO and holidays&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Inclusive culture committed to diverse backgrounds and perspectives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation at Cresta:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Cresta’s approach to compensation is simple: recognize impact, reward excellence, and invest in our people. We offer competitive, location-based pay that reflects the market and what each individual brings to the table.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The posted base salary range represents what we expect to pay for this role in a given location. Final offers are shaped by factors like experience, skills, education, and geography. In addition to base pay, total compensation includes equity and a comprehensive benefits package for you and your family.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Salary Range&lt;/strong&gt;: &lt;strong&gt;$120,000 - $175,000 + Equity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We have noticed a rise in recruiting impersonations across the industry, where scammers attempt to access candidates&#39; personal and financial information through fake interviews and offers. All Cresta recruiting email communications will always come from the @cresta.ai domain. Any outreach claiming to be from Cresta via other sources should be ignored. If you are uncertain whether you have been contacted by an official Cresta employee, reach out to&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;mailto:recruiting@cresta.ai&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;recruiting@cresta.ai&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

