&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements Gathering:&lt;/strong&gt; Collaborate with customers and internal stakeholders to gather technical requirements and translate business needs into AI Agent solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Demos &amp;amp; Iteration:&lt;/strong&gt; Conduct interactive demos and present compelling proof-of-concepts to prospective customers, proactively gather feedback, and iteratively refine solutions to meet objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
