&lt;li&gt;You&#39;ll vibe code/vibe design in Cursor or Claude for proof-of-concept, then apply rigor and thoughtfulness to make it an enterprise-ready experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;ll advocate for craft - raise the quality bar and help the team develop a shared eye for what great looks like.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;ll drive cross-squad alignment by understanding their needs, and secure buy-in and drive adoption from stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;ll have good judgment about when to ship: perfect is the enemy of good.&lt;/li&gt;
