&lt;p&gt;Over the next few years, AI is going to redefine how people all over the world interact with businesses every day. Come build that future at Cresta.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;About the role:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a founding Strategic Account Executive for Iberia, you will own 8-12 of the largest strategic accounts across Spain and/or Portugal — IBEX35-caliber banking, telco, insurance, utilities, and travel enterprises. You&#39;ll run complex, multi-level sales cycles from 6 to 18 months, build both the business case and the technical win alongside your Solutions Consultant, and drive long-term land-and-expand strategy while continuing to bring in new logos.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As part of the founding Iberia team, you&#39;ll work alongside a 10-person Madrid-based org (SDR, SC, and Customer Success) and help shape the region&#39;s go-to-market strategy from the ground up.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage a portfolio of 8-12 top strategic accounts in Spain and/or Portugal&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generate your own pipeline — Cresta drives strong inbound, but Strategic AEs are expected to self-source roughly 50% of pipeline&lt;/li&gt;
