&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Product, Marketing, Customer Success, and Engineering to deliver an exceptional customer experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Qualifications We Value:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of enterprise SaaS sales experience, including at least 4 years as a quota-carrying individual contributor selling into large Spanish enterprises (IBEX35 or equivalent: banking, telco, insurance, utilities, travel)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Verified track record closing deals of €500K+ ARR / €1M+ TCV, including at least one deal exceeding €1M TCV at an IBEX35-caliber account&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;New-logo hunting as your primary motion — majority of attainment historically from net-new logos rather than installed-base expansion&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience navigating complex 6-18 month cycles, including RFPs, buying committees, and procurement/legal/security review in regulated industries&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Existing C-level/VP network within Spanish enterprise accounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Nice-to-Have:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;CX / contact center / conversational AI domain exposure (CCaaS, WEM, analytics, virtual agents)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience opening a market or territory from zero for a hyper-growth vendor&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience co-selling with SIs and channel partners (e.g. Accenture, Telefónica Tech, Sabio-type ecosystem)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with Ley SAC and Spanish regulatory drivers in customer service&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;MEDDPICC (or equivalent) formally trained&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Language &amp;amp; Travel:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Native or negotiation-grade Spanish, fluent English; Portuguese is a strong plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Madrid-based, with travel across the Iberian Peninsula expected&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Perks &amp;amp; Benefits:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We offer a comprehensive and people-first benefits package to support you at work and in life:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comprehensive medical, dental, and vision coverage with plans to fit you and your family&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible PTO to take the time you need, when you need it&lt;/li&gt;
